Graphic tools for C64

Five programs written by Dave:

Picture Converter - recognizes six common
  graphic image file format
Multicolor Picture Cleaner - makes bitmap
  files to more compressible
Hi-res Picture Cleaner - same thing for 
  hi-res picture files
BMAP Colours - helps to choose colors of
  pure bitmap files
Sprite Peeper - a useful program to seek
  sprites in memory (don't say sprite
  thief!)

(source files included)
